WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:03.208
( music playing )

00:00:15.208 --> 00:00:18.417
( music playing )

00:00:23.208 --> 00:00:24.417
( squeals)

00:00:34.417 --> 00:00:36.583
( panting )

00:00:36.625 --> 00:00:39.125
I think I need bigger lungs.

00:00:40.917 --> 00:00:43.792
How do you like
my sandcastle, Lucy?

00:00:43.834 --> 00:00:45.792
It's not very realistic.

00:00:45.834 --> 00:00:48.792
No one could ever live
in a castle like that.

00:00:48.834 --> 00:00:50.000
( muttering )

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.792
( grown-up talking )

00:00:57.834 --> 00:00:58.792
No, ma'am.

00:00:58.834 --> 00:01:00.750
I'm not going in the water yet.

00:01:00.792 --> 00:01:02.834
I just like being prepared.

00:01:02.875 --> 00:01:04.792
I even brought
this appropriately

00:01:04.834 --> 00:01:06.792
themed novelty cup
full of fluids,

00:01:06.834 --> 00:01:09.208
so I can ensure I stay
properly hydrated.

00:01:11.834 --> 00:01:12.959
( sighs )

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:14.792
H20.

00:01:17.417 --> 00:01:20.166
Sally, have you
seen my beach ball?

00:01:20.208 --> 00:01:22.834
I just let for Hawaii.

00:01:26.417 --> 00:01:28.375
Snoopy,
if you're going surfing,

00:01:28.417 --> 00:01:30.583
I don't want you
going out too far.

00:01:30.625 --> 00:01:33.959
And no riding the big waves,
only the small ones.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:36.500
Surf's up!

00:01:36.542 --> 00:01:38.208
Woohoo!

00:01:40.583 --> 00:01:44.166
And no carving the A-frames!
Or hanging ten!

00:01:44.208 --> 00:01:48.208
And no hot-dogging,
if you'll pardon the expression.

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:51.834
Woohoo! Cowabunga!

00:01:53.417 --> 00:01:56.834
( laughing )

00:01:59.166 --> 00:02:01.000
Looking good, Snoopy.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:03.208
( grunting )

00:02:05.417 --> 00:02:06.834
Woohoo!

00:02:08.417 --> 00:02:09.583
( chittering )

00:02:09.625 --> 00:02:11.125
( chittering )

00:02:13.208 --> 00:02:14.583
Woohoo-hoo-hoo!

00:02:14.625 --> 00:02:17.792
Say, Snoopy's doing
all right out there.

00:02:17.834 --> 00:02:19.959
I can't bear to look.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.125
( squeals )

00:02:22.166 --> 00:02:23.625
Watch out!

00:02:29.625 --> 00:02:32.166
- ( grunting )
- Can I look now?

00:02:32.208 --> 00:02:33.792
I wouldn't, Charlie Brown.

00:02:33.834 --> 00:02:37.166
- Snoopy's about to...
- Wipe out!

00:02:49.417 --> 00:02:50.583
( gasps )

00:02:51.834 --> 00:02:54.041
Oh.

00:02:54.083 --> 00:02:56.208
Ahh.

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:05.625
( laughing )

00:03:07.417 --> 00:03:08.417
( groans )

00:03:10.834 --> 00:03:12.000
( chittering )

00:03:13.834 --> 00:03:15.834
( yawn )

00:03:19.208 --> 00:03:21.583
Snoopy, over here!

00:03:21.625 --> 00:03:23.500
You can swim back
if you want.

00:03:23.542 --> 00:03:25.583
He can probably walk back.

00:03:25.625 --> 00:03:27.208
What a goofball.

